TIMING-27#1 Critical Warning
Invalid primary clock on hierarchical pin  
A primary clock lcd_inst/lcd_clk_pll/inst/clk_in1 is created on an inappropriate internal pin lcd_inst/lcd_clk_pll/inst/clk_in1. It is not recommended to create a primary clock on a hierarchical pin when its driver pin has a fanout connected to multiple clock pins
Related violations: <none>

DPIR-1#1 Warning
Asynchronous driver check  
DSP bram_addra0__0 input pin bram_addra0__0/C[0] is connected to registers with an asynchronous reset. This is preventing the possibility of merging these registers in to the DSP Block since the DSP block registers only possess synchronous reset capability.  It is suggested to recode or change these registers to remove the reset or use a synchronous reset to get the best optimization for performance, power and area.
